  exerciseText: 'There are Resource nodes in the world and the player can activate
    a tool to gather those resources. If near a Resource Node it starts spawning
    Items that the player can then pick up.


    In this Scenario the player can
    move around, press F to start gathering resouces and if nearby a resource node
    it gathers items which the player picks up and shows in the UI.'
